      "position": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": -284
      },
      "params": {
        "text": "Polar coordinates\n\nA point on a circle is (cos(angle)·r, sin(angle)·r). Drive `angle` with time and you get rotation; vary `r` and you get spirals.\n\nThis line goes from the origin out to a rotating point.",
        "width": 360,
        "height": 220
      },
